{"title":"2009 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_6\">Problem 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Steve's empty swimming pool will hold <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/c/bbc0158807f3917700e75565f7041d03e1c06496.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"17\" /> gallons of water when full. It will be filled by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hoses, each of which supplies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/c/40cba44ffc429fc98e11a1605ced22243b655f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> gallons of water per minute. How many hours will it take to fill Steve's pool?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/8/1c85d9625aefdee6f8084766f489ca6224a44f5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\  40  \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\   42  \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\  44   \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\  46   \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\   48$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each of the four hoses hose fills <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/1/2c11cf15ef954654d09a034c37d3b6b068aa3c5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24,000/4 = 6,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"139\" height=\"18\" /> gallons of water. At the rate it goes at it will take <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/9/c69a552074a8b75c6886d76e4ac39610508a2bab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6,000/2.5 = 2400$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"136\" height=\"18\" /> minutes, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/e/53e3153168cac92604c90460e04877a9de63f052.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" /> hours.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If all four hoses fill <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/c/40cba44ffc429fc98e11a1605ced22243b655f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> gallons a minute, every minute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> gallons would be added. Since every hour has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/a/caa9bc3e1ca566d171ec6b80e39ee4cc913b5aa1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$600$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> gallons of water would be added every hour. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/9/069cf0f0a2381716d33547d8d8c4880ea083ca99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24000/600=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"172\" height=\"30\" /> hours.\n</p><p>~Trex226\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/USVVURBLaAc?t=288\">https://youtu.be/USVVURBLaAc?t=288</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/UkMGKf172E0\">https://youtu.be/UkMGKf172E0</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8\" title=\"2009 AMC 8\">2009 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2009\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2009 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2009 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2009 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</